pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: prob-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 50, 4, 28]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: prob-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 48, 900, 34]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      fontSize: 26
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>El estudiante universitario peruano enfrenta un problema de retención</p>
  - elementId: prob-card-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 120, 360, 200]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [16000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000010"
      offset: [0, 3]
  - elementId: prob-icon-1
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [80, 140, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:microphone"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$info"
  - elementId: prob-head-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 185, 320, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Grabaciones sin utilidad</strong></p>
  - elementId: prob-body-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 220, 320, 85]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>Los estudiantes graban clases pero no tienen herramientas para convertir ese audio en material de estudio accionable.</p>
  - elementId: prob-card-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [460, 120, 360, 200]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [16000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000010"
      offset: [0, 3]
  - elementId: prob-icon-2
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [480, 140, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:file-lines"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$warning"
  - elementId: prob-head-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [480, 185, 320, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Apuntes masivos, sin estructura</strong></p>
  - elementId: prob-body-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [480, 220, 320, 85]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>Textos largos que no se transforman en flashcards, quizzes ni resúmenes. El estudiante no sabe por dónde empezar.</p>
  - elementId: prob-card-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [860, 120, 360, 200]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [16000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000010"
      offset: [0, 3]
  - elementId: prob-icon-3
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [880, 140, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:chart-line"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: prob-head-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 185, 320, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Sin seguimiento de progreso</strong></p>
  - elementId: prob-body-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 220, 320, 85]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>No existe plataforma que genere contenido a partir de las clases propias del estudiante y mida su dominio real.</p>
  - elementId: prob-big-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 360, 200, 80]
    content:
      style: "$bigNumber"
      fontSize: 64
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>94%</p>
  - elementId: prob-big-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 445, 400, 60]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$secondary"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>de profesionales L&D favorece el microaprendizaje</p>
  - elementId: prob-solution-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 530, 1160, 100]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#e8f5e0"
  - elementId: prob-solution-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [90, 560, 36, 36]
    iconName: "fas:lightbulb"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: prob-solution-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [145, 545, 1050, 70]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p><strong>SIMA</strong> convierte audio/texto de clase en resúmenes, flashcards, quizzes adaptativos y recomendaciones personalizadas — calibrado con IRT 3PL y taxonomía Bloom.</p>
  - elementId: prob-footer-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 660, 40, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
